{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":310,"mirrow":false,"y":-286,"img":"chara033_1","addImg":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1d"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":310,"mirrow":false,"y":-286,"img":"chara033_1","addImg":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1d"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]啊，是{myName}！快来快来，我刚猎了头猪，做了好几种口味的烤肉！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]嘻嘻，我的手艺不错吧？这都是我打小练出来的。[r]我们家里穷，一年到头吃不到几口肉，所以我和妹妹常去野外打猎！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]当时我和露帕还没现在这么强，打猎很费劲，连着好几天可能都一无所获。[r]但每次成功，都超有成就感！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]打完猎，我们就在尾指村附近搭篝火烹饪。[r]那感觉和现在营地差不多，当然没这么豪华就是啦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]起初我们不会烤肉，总是把肉烤焦。[r]我还记得有一次露帕想用魔法来烤肉，结果没控制好属性，直接用水炮把肉冲成了渣渣！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]嘿嘿……光说以前的事情了。来，趁热吃吧，试试我做的湖风烤肉！[r]忙碌了一天，就该放轻松下来，大口吃肉～！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"乌帕-熟识1","script":"yd_033_04"}